+config TYPEC_MAX77705
+	tristate "Maxim MAX77705 Type-C and USB PD controller driver"
+	depends on I2C
+	depends on MFD_MAX77705
+	depends on REGULATOR
+	depends on POWER_SUPPLY
+	depends on USB_ROLE_SWITCH || !USB_ROLE_SWITCH
+	select REGMAP_I2C
+	help
+	  Say Y or M here if your system has the Maxim MAX77705 companion
+	  PMIC with its Type-C/PD controller (CCIC) wired to a USB-C port.
+	  The driver reports the port to the Type-C class, switches the USB
+	  data role and VBUS, and negotiates fixed-voltage PD contracts as a
+	  sink through the CCIC firmware.
+
+	  If you choose to build this driver as a dynamically linked module, the
+	  module will be called max77705.ko.
